            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.15.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Claude and Codex: 2.15.3's one-time re-pricing of past days could be skipped. Running the <code>runic</code> command-line tool before the app marked it done without re-pricing anything, so past days stayed at $0. It now counts as done only after a full rescan. This update runs it again.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
